  "goodToKnow": "Dummerweise means unfortunately or stupidly, used to comment on an annoying situation: Dummerweise war der Akku leer. It's colloquial. Comment adverbs with -erweise are common: glücklicherweise (fortunately), ärgerlicherweise (annoyingly), möglicherweise (possibly), seltsamerweise (strangely). Dumm means stupid and also unfortunate: Das ist dumm gelaufen (that went badly)."
